  "Group": "Acquisition",
  "Category": "Pointing",
  "Description": "Pointing Data Acquisition: acquires the pointer events of the pointing devices - a mouse, a pen, a finger on a touch surface - and provides them as a Basic Pointer Object. It is not one device but a plurality of them, and the Basic Pointer Object carries the events its devices give: any of its attributes may be missing.",
